SYSTEM = Si(111) + upright H2 above Si 13, rerun of one scan point (single point)

Start (run.sh switches to ISTART=1/ICHARG=1 when it restarts from the previous point)
ISTART =  0
ICHARG =  2

Electronic
GGA    = PE
IVDW   = 12            (D3-BJ, same as the previous 6.00 scans)
ENCUT  = 400
PREC   = Normal
LREAL  = Auto
ALGO   = Normal
EDIFF  = 1E-05
NELM   = 300

Spin: slab starts non-magnetic, the two H opposite (broken-symmetry singlet)
ISPIN    = 2
MAGMOM   = 24*0 -1 1   ! H spins flipped so the total moment is +1
AMIX_MAG = 0.8
BMIX_MAG = 0.0001
NUPDOWN  = 1   ! fixed total moment: non-magnetic slab (mirror of -1; VASP reads -1 as "no constraint")

Smearing (use E0 for the PES)
ISMEAR = 0
SIGMA  = 0.2

No ionic motion: H-H distance is fixed by POSCAR
IBRION = -1
NSW    = 0

Parallelization (32 MPI ranks, 16 irreducible k-points)
KPAR   = 16
NCORE  = 2

Output
LORBIT = 11
LWAVE  = .TRUE.
LCHARG = .TRUE.
